**/output/**
**/outputs/
**/outputs/**
**/runs/
**/runs/**
**/checkpoints/
**/checkpoints/**
**/ckpt/
**/ckpt/**
**/logs/
**/logs/**
**/log/
**/log/**
**/train/
**/train/**
