**/eval/**
**/result/
**/result/**
**/results/
**/results/**
**/reports/
**/reports/**
**/videos/
**/videos/**
**/video/
**/video/**
**/rollout_videos/
**/rollout_videos/**

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Non-core docs / external vendored dependencies
# ------------------------------------------------------------
**/docs/
**/docs/**
**/reports/
**/reports/**
**/experiment_artifacts/
**/experiment_artifacts/**
**/flash-linear-attention/
**/flash-linear-attention/**

# Heavy/generated file types
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.bag
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.gif
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.webm
*.obj
*.stl
*.glb
*.gltf
*.urdf.log
*.log
*.out
*.err
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.bundle
core
core.*

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Temporary / one-off scripts and scratch files inside code trees
# Keep reusable scripts, ignore obvious scratch/patch/remote diagnostics.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
**/tmp_*
**/*_tmp*
**/temp_*
**/*_temp*
**/backup*
**/backups/
**/backups/**
**/*backup*
**/patch_*
**/remote_*
**/diagnose_*
**/inspect_*
**/debug_*
**/check_*
**/test_output*

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-allow lightweight docs/config placeholders if they live in ignored dirs
# ------------------------------------------------------------
!**/README.md
!**/.gitkeep
!**/.gitignore

# Extra code-only release ignores
**/experiments/
**/experiments/**
**/archive/
**/archive/**
**/archived/
**/archived/**
**/docs/
**/docs/**
**/.codex
**/codex.md
**/*before_server_path_fix*
**/loading
**/saving


# GAPartNet: keep algorithm code and project skeleton, ignore heavy artifacts.
!/GAPartNet/
!/GAPartNet/**
/GAPartNet/.git/
/GAPartNet/.git/**
/GAPartNet/**/__pycache__/
/GAPartNet/**/__pycache__/**
/GAPartNet/**/output/*
/GAPartNet/**/outputs/*
/GAPartNet/**/runs/*
/GAPartNet/**/logs/*
/GAPartNet/**/ckpt/*
/GAPartNet/**/checkpoints/*
